                  "key": "liveChatId",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) The liveChatId parameter specifies the ID of the live chat whose messages will be returned. The live chat ID associated with a broadcast is returned in the liveBroadcast resource's snippet.liveChatId property."
